file crypto/MODULES.md 87 rows in fifteen families, each sentence from that module's own //! head
file crypto/LADDER.md the rung tables word for word with their published references
file crypto/PARITY.md the seventeen Monocypher rungs, the timing horizon, and the custody gate
file docs/CRYPTO.md 596 non-ASCII to zero, the stale tools/ witness pattern repointed, counts pointed at the guard
file tools/fixtures/prose_register_scan.sh crypto/README.md joins the DOOR roster so a meter reads it
file construction/REDS.md row %191, and rows %188-%189 folded to keep the pin under bound
file construction/ITINERARY.md landed rounds condensed out of Next; the live edge is constel/README.md and docs/CRYPTO.md's size
recommend keep-going constel/README.md at 69,979 bytes is the last unsplit module front door and its 31 .rye sources make it the smallest of the five splits -- the scan already serves three directories, so its guard is a witness file rather than a fourth copy of a rule; take the named-against-standing count first, as the last two laps did
